<title>USA: U.S. daily primary aluminum output rises in Nov.</title>
<headline>U.S. daily primary aluminum output rises in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The daily rate of primary aluminum production in November rose to 9,832 tonnes compared to 9,484 tonnes in November last year, and a revised 9,806 tonnes in October, the Aluminum Association reported.</p>
<p>November's daily rate was the highest for any month this year and last.</p>
<p>The annual rate of production in November was 3,598,439 tonnes compared to 1996's actual output of 3,375,241 tonnes.</p>
<p>Production in November totaled 294,954 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
